# DE/HSYNC/VSYNC: candidates AG10, AG11, AH12 (bank 44) or AG13, AD15 (bank 24),
# UNVERIFIED (U8): assigned when measured on J15.

# ---- front panel and offset DACs: the bank-25/26 bus (G10, F10, F12, F11, F13,
# F15, J12, H11) and the control word (B10, B11, A10, A12, A11, C12, D12, D10,
# C11), functions UNVERIFIED (U9, U10): left unused until probed.

# ---- every other ball stays unused (high impedance), spec 12 §7.1
